# Log field filters for every log on the VM's Caddy that names requests: the site's access log
# and the default log, where reverse-proxy failures and other errors are written with the
# request. Caddy redacts Authorization and Cookie on its own, but not X-Pim-Bridge-Authorization,
# x-cua-env-authorization (viewer tickets) or a query (/media?ticket=…). Import it inside each
# `format filter { fields { … } }`.
request>headers delete
request>uri regexp \?.*$ ?REDACTED
uri regexp \?.*$ ?REDACTED
